# Query XML Fix - AVADocuHistoryCleanupQuery

## Issue
The AOT Query XML file was not well-formed and was missing required D365FO metadata elements.

## What Was Wrong

### Original XML Structure (Incomplete):
```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<AxQuery xmlns:i="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
	<Name>AVADocuHistoryCleanupQuery</Name>
	<Label>DocuHistory Cleanup Query</Label>
	<Description>...</Description>
	<DataSources>
		<AxQuerySimpleRootDataSource>
			<Name>DocuHistory</Name>
			<DynamicFields>Yes</DynamicFields>
			<Table>DocuHistory</Table>
			<Fields>...</Fields>
			<Ranges>...</Ranges>
		</AxQuerySimpleRootDataSource>
	</DataSources>
</AxQuery>
```

### Problems Identified:
1. ❌ Missing `xmlns=""` attribute in root element
2. ❌ Missing `i:type="AxQuerySimple"` attribute
3. ❌ No `SourceCode` section with query class declaration
4. ❌ Missing required empty elements: `<DataSources />`, `<DerivedDataSources />`, `<GroupBy />`, `<Having />`, `<OrderBy />`
5. ❌ No QueryRun class definition

