## D365FO Query XML Requirements Checklist

For future reference, a valid D365FO query XML must have:

- ✅ Root element: `<AxQuery>`
- ✅ Namespace attributes: `xmlns:i`, `xmlns`, `i:type`
- ✅ Query name: `<Name>`
- ✅ SourceCode section with:
  - ✅ classDeclaration method
  - ✅ [Query] attribute
  - ✅ extends QueryRun
- ✅ Label and Description
- ✅ DataSources section with:
  - ✅ Root data source
  - ✅ Table name
  - ✅ DynamicFields setting
  - ✅ Fields collection
  - ✅ Ranges collection
  - ✅ Empty required elements (DataSources, DerivedDataSources, GroupBy, Having)
  - ✅ OrderBy section (if sorting needed)

